### Oil & Gas Tracking - AdminService HTTP tests
### Requires the REST Client (VS Code) extension. Run `cds watch` first.

@host = http://localhost:4004
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Create a product (needed before stock-in / sales tests)
POST {{host}}/admin/Products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Crude Oil",
  "type": "Crude Oil",
  "unit": "Gallons"
}

### 2. List products (copy an ID from here into @productId below)
GET {{host}}/admin/Products
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Set this to a real Products.ID returned above before running the requests below
@productId = 01


### --- StockIns (goods coming in) ---

### 3. Stock-in: valid entry -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/admin/StockIns
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_ID": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 1000,
  "unitPrice": 2.5,
  "supplier": "ABC Refinery"
}

### 4. Stock-in: missing product -> 400 error
POST {{host}}/admin/StockIns
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 100
}

### 5. Stock-in: invalid quantity -> 400 error
POST {{host}}/admin/StockIns
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_ID": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": -5
}

### 6. List all stock-in entries
GET {{host}}/admin/StockIns
Accept: {{contentType}}


### --- Sales ---

### 7. Sale: valid entry within available stock -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/admin/Sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_ID": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 300,
  "customer": "Acme Corp"
}

### 8. Sale: quantity exceeds available stock -> 400 error
POST {{host}}/admin/Sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_ID": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "customer": "Big Buyer"
}

### 9. Sale: missing product -> 400 error
POST {{host}}/admin/Sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 10
}

### 10. Sale: invalid quantity -> 400 error
POST {{host}}/admin/Sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_ID": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 11. List all sales entries
GET {{host}}/admin/Sales
Accept: {{contentType}}
